{"id":"n14305-1-7","stage":5,"title":"각박하다 · 刻薄","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14305-1-7-1","ko":"얼마 전에 옆집에 도둑이 들었는데 아무도 몰랐대요.","zh":"前阵子隔壁进了小偷，却听说谁都不知道。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼마","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옆집에","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도둑이","meaning":"小偷，盗贼，窃贼","explanation":"도둑：小偷，盗贼，窃贼；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"도둑","audio":"/audio/9eaab0702752d6341042.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47813","senseId":"2","lemma":"도둑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었는데","meaning":"进去，进入","explanation":"들다：进去，进入；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"1","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아무도","meaning":"任何，什么","explanation":"아무：任何，什么；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아무","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71327","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰랐대요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"未确定的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"比一定时期早。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"9eaab0702752d634","term":"도둑","zh":"小偷，盗贼，窃贼","audio":"/audio/9eaab0702752d6341042.mp3","entryId":"47813","definition":"窃取或抢夺别人的东西的人。","pronunciation":["도둑"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"进去，进入","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"从外面进到里面或进来里面。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"1bb289b6e5d9e641","term":"아무","zh":"任何，什么","audio":"/audio/1bb289b6e5d9e641ff85.mp3","entryId":"71327","definition":"用于指不特定的某人或某物。","pronunciation":["아ː무"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c4379a232b9f602cda79.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14305-1-7-2","ko":"세상이 각박해서 옆집에 무슨 일이 있는지 알기가 어려워요.","zh":"如今人情淡薄，很难知道邻居家发生了什么。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세상이","meaning":"世道","explanation":"세상：世道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"세상","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62441","senseId":"7","lemma":"세상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"각박해서","meaning":"刻薄，吝啬","explanation":"각박하다：刻薄，吝啬；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"각박하다","audio":"/audio/99b940ffe9ce7bc22fd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14305","senseId":"1","lemma":"각박하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옆집에","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"继续上班。","explanation":"있다：继续上班。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알기가","meaning":"知道，明白","explanation":"알다：知道，明白；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"1","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어려워요.","meaning":"艰难，困难","explanation":"어렵다：艰难，困难；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"2","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"412ee72fe0ab7746","term":"세상","zh":"世道","audio":"/audio/412ee72fe0ab7746e409.mp3","entryId":"62441","definition":"世上的人心。","pronunciation":["세ː상"]},{"id":"99b940ffe9ce7bc2","term":"각박하다","zh":"刻薄，吝啬","audio":"/audio/99b940ffe9ce7bc22fd2.mp3","entryId":"14305","definition":"没有人情味，很残忍。","pronunciation":["각빠카다"]},{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"继续上班。","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68796","definition":"继续上班。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"知道，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"通过教育、经验、思考等来，具备与事物或情况相关的信息或知识。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"艰难，困难","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"有很多难事或苦难。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1ddaa664f0cdce0f83e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.356,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14305","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["如今人情淡薄，很难知道邻居家发生了什么。","前阵子隔壁进了小偷，却听说谁都不知道。","在所有的花里，我最喜欢玫瑰了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["前阵子隔壁进了小偷，却听说谁都不知道。","在所有的花里，我最喜欢玫瑰了。","如今人情淡薄，很难知道邻居家发生了什么。"],"answer":2}]}
